 record the interpunct. Again, the space to complete VX[OR] is limited, although not impossible, and so perhaps abbreviated.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":260,"html":261},"translation","\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":263,"html":264},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":266,"html":267},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1989.0338k \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manganaro 1989 165 no.19 fig.19 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Fasolo 2013 83 no.30 fig.56 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002011\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002011\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":269,"html":270},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[272,274,277,279,282,283,286,287],{"html":273},"Text encoding: Alex Antoniou, Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Coccato 2024-07-05, in storage",{"id":275,"lang":150,"html":276},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Auli\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">A(uli)\u003C/span>\u003C/span> · \u003Cspan data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">f(ilio)\u003C/span> · \u003Cspan data-text=\"Quirina\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Quirina\">Qụ[ir](ina)\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=